Allow repository cloning to wait until pod startup

Add build.repoClone in .rumpelpod.json so prepared images can skip
transferring the host Git directory to the builder. Local cloning
remains the default, and skip mode reuses checkouts from the base image.

Initialize missing repositories at startup and apply the same remotes
and commit hooks as baked checkouts before fetching from the host. Keep
clone mode in the prepared-image cache key so changing it takes effect.
